summary:
  A player handed a new source keeps the count it had.

history:
  A new source is a new connection of the player's own; the helper's follows
  ten seconds after that one, not on top of it.

target:
  package/contents/ui/Loudness.qml

find:
              loud._follow(true);
              if (loud.mayAsk) settle.restart();

replace:
              loud._follow(true);
              if (loud.mayAsk && !settle.running) settle.restart();

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_loudness.qml::test_a_station_is_listened_to_once_it_has_sounded_for_a_while.
  Line-neutral.
